  "supportFaqQ1": "What is Vinkol?",
  "supportFaqA1": "Vinkol is a digital platform that connects customers with professional delivery partners for fast, secure and reliable logistics.",
  "supportFaqQ2": "How does Vinkol work?",
  "supportFaqA2": "Book a delivery in the app, give the pickup and drop-off details, pay, and follow the order's status until it is delivered.",
  "supportFaqQ3": "Is my parcel insured during delivery?",
  "supportFaqA3Covered": "Vinkol provides retention coverage of up to {amount} for theft or damage to goods during delivery, provided the loss is verified and happened without negligence by the rider or logistics company.",
  "@supportFaqA3Covered": {
    "description": "Coverage figure comes from the market; the amount is already formatted in the market's currency.",
    "placeholders": {
      "amount": {
        "type": "String"
      }
    }
  },
  "supportFaqA3Uncovered": "Coverage for theft or damage during delivery depends on the delivery partner. Contact Vinkol support to open a claim and we will mediate where applicable.",
  "supportFaqQ4": "Who is responsible if my parcel is damaged or lost?",
  "supportFaqA4": "Vinkol facilitates the booking, and each delivery partner is directly responsible for carrying out the delivery. Claims should be directed to the partner involved; Vinkol will help mediate the dispute where necessary.",
  "supportFaqQ5": "How do I make sure my item is safe to send?",
  "supportFaqA5": "Package it so it cannot be damaged in transit. Fragile or high-value items should be wrapped and labelled clearly before pickup.",
  "supportFaqQ6": "How do I follow my delivery?",
  "supportFaqA6": "Open the order under Records. Its status moves from pending, to with a rider or shopper, to delivered. Statuses are for information and are not a legal or financial record.",
  "supportFaqQ7": "What should I do if something goes wrong with a delivery?",
  "supportFaqA7": "Report it through the app or contact support within 48 hours of the delivery attempt. Vinkol will review and mediate your case where applicable.",
  "supportFaqQ8": "Can I cancel or change a delivery request?",
  "supportFaqA8": "You can cancel or change a request before a rider accepts it. Once a delivery is under way, cancellation terms depend on the stage it has reached.",
  "supportFaqQ9": "Can I contact the rider?",
  "supportFaqA9": "Yes. Once a rider is assigned, the order shows their number and you can call them. There is no in-app chat.",
  "supportFaqQ10": "How will I hear about delivery updates?",
  "supportFaqA10": "Vinkol sends a push notification when your order changes status. Notifications are not stored, so there is no inbox to go back to.",
  "supportFaqQ11": "Does Vinkol store my personal data?",
  "supportFaqA11": "Vinkol collects only what it needs to complete your delivery, and handles it in line with data-protection law and our privacy policy.",
  "supportFaqQ12": "How often do the terms change?",
  "supportFaqA12": "Vinkol may update its terms and conditions from time to time. Continuing to use the platform after an update means you accept the new terms.",
  "supportFaqQ13": "How do I contact support?",
  "supportFaqA13": "Use the contact options at the top of this screen. Phone and email are answered {hours}.",
